CONTEXT_EN=[
 'Medical horror and its neighboring genre labels provide context; no label alone requires darkness, gore, nudity, sexual meaning or a fixed collection of medical props.',
 'The medical gaze, bodily autonomy, abjection, biopower and related critical concepts retain their theoretical contexts; visible appearance is not proof of a person’s moral value, pathology or monstrous nature.',
 'Diagnostic uncertainty, diagnostic error, false test results, idiopathic conditions, iatrogenic harm and medical gaslighting are distinct contextual claims; a chart or worried face alone cannot establish them.',
 'Consciousness, pain, movement and remembered experience are separate axes. Being awake during local or regional anesthesia is not by itself anesthesia failure; immobility alone proves neither unconsciousness nor lack of pain.',
 'Coma, locked-in syndrome and brain death are distinct states. A bedside appearance, open eyes or a breathing machine cannot establish their diagnosis or clinical criteria.',
 'Medical phobias, hallucination, depersonalization, Capgras or Cotard delusions and delirium require their clinical and experiential contexts. A staged image is not a diagnosis of its subject.',
 'Phantom limb pain and nocebo involve subjective pain or expectation-related causation. An absent body part, pill bottle or expression does not prove the experience or its cause.',
 'Ischemia concerns blood supply, hypoxia concerns oxygen supply and atrophy has its own temporal and clinical meaning. Skin color or a narrow limb is insufficient diagnostic evidence.',
 'Contamination, colonization, infection, biofilm and healthcare association remain separate claims. Visible film, stained equipment or a clinical room does not establish microorganisms, infection or transmission.',
 'Parasitism, zoonotic transmission, prion disease and sepsis are different relations or mechanisms. An attached shape or dark liquid is not evidence of those diagnoses.',
 'Transplantation, rejection, immunosuppression, foreign-body reaction and xenotransplantation remain distinct. A seam or implant alone does not establish an immune process, donor source or animal transformation.',
 'Chimerism, mosaicism, cloning and genetic engineering have distinct cell origins and mechanisms. Similar appearances or sample labels do not establish genetic identity, memory or personhood.',
 'Organoids, tissue engineering, cell-line persistence and artificial-womb research do not by themselves establish a miniature person, consciousness, complete ectogenesis, donor-memory transfer or remote control of an implant.',
 'Informed consent, decision-making capacity, coercion, undue influence, therapeutic misconception and paternalism require their actual scope and circumstances. A signature, smile or compliant pose is insufficient evidence.',
 'Institutional betrayal, dual loyalty, exploitation, involuntary admission, restraint, tissue use and trafficking retain their legal and historical contexts. A closed door, medicine or donation container alone does not establish abuse.',
 'Pregnancy, termination, sterilization, obstetric violence, sex-characteristic changes and genital injury retain their distinct bodily and consent contexts. Appearance alone cannot establish reproductive capacity, prior intervention or coercion.',
 'Clinical exposure, sexual interest, consensual adult roleplay, voyeurism, sexual boundary violation, forced exposure, surgical eroticism and necrophilia are distinct meanings. Medical clothing alone proves none of them.',
 'Human experimentation, vivisection, autopsy, self-surgery, historical lobotomy and modern electroconvulsive therapy retain distinct purposes, life states and consent contexts. Tools or electrodes alone do not prove torture or a particular procedure.',
 'Historical body snatching, corpse medicine and fictional reanimation are different claims. A covered stretcher or interest in anatomy does not establish a corpse, trade, resurrection or sexual interest.',
 'Escalating treatment, a false cure, denial of discharge, concealed records, reproductive commodification and identity replacement require sequence or narrative context. A single still frame cannot establish their history or causation.',
 'Mechanical breathing cycles, fluorescent hum and bodily sounds are temporal or auditory phenomena. A still photograph of tubing, a lamp or a wet surface cannot establish the sound.',
 'Historical cases retain their evidence: the Tuskegee study involved lack of informed consent and withheld treatment rather than deliberate infection; HeLa cell persistence is not personal consciousness; eugenic rankings are not scientific facts.'
]

